  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **The Grobe** (2 reviews): The squeegee moment falls immediately after track 12, The Grobe, rather than being its own separate track; The separate squeegee track should be merged onto the end of The Grobe; duplicated files also need removing [3][4]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Learnin to love**: back after 38 archived shows (871 days) [5]\n- **i wuz nothing**: rare: 10 archived performances [5]\n- **Cold and Wet**: back after 78 archived shows (1815 days); rare: 9 archived performances [5]\n- **Bumblebee Tease**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [5]\n- **Dont get 2 close to my fantasy**: back after 225 archived shows (5365 days); rare: 5 archived performances [5]\n- **Choloate Town (NC rain eq. failure)**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [5]\n- **Kim Smoltz**: rare: 14 archived performances [5]\n- **Golden Eeel**: back after 327 archived shows (6855 days); mythic rare: 2 archived performances [5]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **ween2022-07-03** (recommended): source not stated; 33 songs; 140 min; rated 1.67/5 by 3 [1]. Said about its sound: Reviewer says the sound quality of the recording is good [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **ween2022-07-03**: taped by KavG; transferred by KavG; source: AT822>premix 6II>SD [1]",
